# Equilibrium Adept: flurry gives it double strike when its controller casts their second spell in a turn - not the first (Mox
# Jet) and not the opponent's own second spell on T2 (Mox Pearl, Mox Jet). The double strike lasts until end of turn: it is
# gone on T4.

